[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3619811156","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113636#issuecomment-3619811156","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113636","id":3619811156,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Xwe9U","user":{"login":"zhehangd","id":9572364,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1NzIzNjQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9572364?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhehangd","html_url":"https://github.com/zhehangd","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhehangd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhehangd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhehangd/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhehangd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhehangd/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhehangd/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhehangd/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhehangd/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhehangd/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-06T09:35:57Z","updated_at":"2025-12-06T09:40:42Z","body":"It works normally on my Ubuntu X11, and for both Forward+ and Compatibility. May be Arch Linux specific?\n\nGodot v4.5.1.stable - Ubuntu 24.04.2 LTS 24.04 on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1080 Ti (nvidia; 535.274.02) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-6850K CPU @ 3.60GHz (12 threads) - 31.25 GiB memory\n\nWorks fine on 4.6 as well.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3619811156/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3619877015","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113636#issuecomment-3619877015","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113636","id":3619877015,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7XwvCX","user":{"login":"timothyqiu","id":372476,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MjQ3Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/372476?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu","html_url":"https://github.com/timothyqiu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-06T10:29:01Z","updated_at":"2025-12-08T05:06:55Z","body":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/dec5a373d97cbadce5e1fabe6095ae9957ff3aa6/platform/linuxbsd/freedesktop_portal_desktop.cpp#L55\n\nI checked the source code and see reference to the `org.freedesktop.portal.Screenshot` DBus interface in the source code.\n\n~I can confirm that my system does not support this interface~, so this is likely to be caused by not properly falling back in this situation. (Update: the interface is supported, but calling it fails consistently.)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3619877015/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"